    "proximate_text": "while adding makeup water to the primary water system, the Turbine Building Operator misdiagnosed the response of the Leakage Water Return Valve and closed the valve manually. This prevented transfer of makeup water from the standpipe to the Primary Water tank... which led to a Main Turbine/Generator trip and Reactor Scram.",
